yarn-error.log
# Untracked because the local dev registry writes its resolution into it: one
# "resolved": "http://localhost:4873/..." per package, and npm prefers that URL on a later
# install — so a committed lockfile makes `npm install` fail for every clone not running
# Verdaccio. Matches examples/angular, which has always ignored its own. Nothing here needs
# it pinned: no `npm ci` runs anywhere in this repo, and the documented repair for an
# install problem in an example is to DELETE this file. examples/bare-rn keeps its lock —
# it is the measurement baseline and carries no @symbiote-native dependency to contaminate.
package-lock.json

# fastlane
#
# It is recommended to not store the screenshots in the git repo. Instead, use fastlane to re-generate the
# screenshots whenever they are needed.
# For more information about the recommended setup visit:
# https://docs.fastlane.tools/best-practices/source-control/

**/fastlane/report.xml
**/fastlane/Preview.html
**/fastlane/screenshots
**/fastlane/test_output

